    },
    "Create a Google account used only for WitnessRecord, and sign in to it here. Crucially, do not add that account to your iPhone's Settings, the Gmail or Drive apps, or any browser you're signed into. Then there is no way to open that Drive from your phone to delete anything — the account simply isn't reachable through the phone's apps. This app keeps its own private login and offers no way to view or delete the footage." : {

